0..57 Comment "// This source shows a model law that collapses one sort."
58..60 Comment "//"
61..136 Comment "// `CollapsedDot` proves that every `Dot` loop is the same. The law has the"
137..214 Comment "// shape of axiom K. It is sound where K on the native identity is not. A law"
215..292 Comment "// is a hypothesis, not a rule. A cell of the theory is a path in its models,"
293..317 Comment "// not a path in `Type`."
318..320 Comment "//"
321..388 Comment "// The checker requires each model to prove the law at its carrier."
389..391 Comment "//"
392..471 Comment "// Limits: the native `Path` admits no such law. `here` is not a pattern, and a"
472..545 Comment "// law over a path of paths has no form today. So K reaches the sort of a"
546..624 Comment "// theory only as an obligation on its models. It is never a fact about `Path`"
625..638 Comment "// or `Flow`."
639..641 Comment "//"
642..692 Comment "// - see: pathological/modules/law-collapsed.gandr"
693..743 Comment "// - see: pathological/identity/k-derivation.gandr"
